abstract: >-
  Publication-oriented code for evaluating ground-truth-localized breast ultrasound
  lesion classification, including leakage-controlled internal evaluation,
  localization robustness, Grad-CAM attribution, preprocessing ablation,
  probability calibration, and zero-shot external validation.
